RealKevbase is the brand store; SaveSimple is its printable-PDF collection. The rules and
procedures are in `AGENTS.md` — read it before changing the API, the SPA or the catalog.

- `zz_tp/` is an independent project with its own manual (`zz_tp/AGENTS.md`): add a file there
  when a task needs one, never overwrite or delete what is already there.
- Ship with `./scripts/deploy.sh --yes`; it refuses while the catalog is out of sync.
- Navigate with `lua scripts/repo-intel.lua overview|symbol <Name>|deps <X>` before opening
  whole files.
